to greet someone:
    say someone
to area with width and height:
    give back width times height
to pi:
    give back 3.14
greet "Paris".
greet with "Rome".
call greet with "Oslo".
call pi.
pi.
say area of 3 and 4
say area with 3 and 4
say area using 3, 4
say area of (1 plus 2) and 4
say area of 3 and 4 is 12
say pi times 2
if area of 1 and 2 is 2, say "yes"
say area of (area of 1 and 2) and 3
say fib of (n minus 1) plus fib of (n minus 2)
say (fib of n) followed by " "
